// The three try shapes and their protection counts. A catch body that throws
// must still run `regardless` before the new error propagates, which is why
// catch-plus-finally needs *two* TRY_PUSH/TRY_POP pairs; and a finally with
// no catch still protects the body and re-chucks.
sketchy {
    chuck "a"
} my_bad (e) {
    chuck "b"
} regardless {
    yap "cleanup"
}

sketchy {
    yap 1
} regardless {
    yap "cleanup"
}
